    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aDream Abyss: Survivors\u300b</strong> is a <strong>roguelike action RPG</strong> infused with anime-style visuals and \u201cbullet heaven\u201d gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Lily</strong>, a brave girl diving into a surreal dreamworld to rescue her sister <strong>Lumi</strong>, lost in the depths of a nightmare.<br>As you progress through the stages, <strong>story events unfold</strong>, and you\u2019ll <strong>meet allies and unlock new playable characters</strong> along your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Playable Anime-Style Heroines</strong><br>Each with unique fighting styles, exclusive skills, and beautifully crafted 3D models.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/fccb4b9727b17e8aa6b4ce88c935a466.poster.avif?t=1749238671\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/fccb4b9727b17e8aa6b4ce88c935a466.webm?t=1749238671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/fccb4b9727b17e8aa6b4ce88c935a466.mp4?t=1749238671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Stages Featuring Towns and Dungeons</strong><br>Explore distinct environments filled with secrets, story, and escalating challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels: Easy / Nightmare / Hell</strong> <br>Whether you're a beginner or a hardcore survivor, challenge awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/e0db68b35279b243924efd946876cad2.avif?t=1749238671\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Variety with Deep Progression Systems</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 - 24 Exclusive Skills + 17 Shared Skills = 41 total skills to mix and match</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 - 38 Enhancement Cards and 26 Stat Boosts to create your own builds each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/da56a1c7d299c86f51373f55b910fce9.poster.avif?t=1749238671\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/da56a1c7d299c86f51373f55b910fce9.webm?t=1749238671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/da56a1c7d299c86f51373f55b910fce9.mp4?t=1749238671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/dfcdb1346d12317f6db1ced4c431cd73.poster.avif?t=1749238671\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/dfcdb1346d12317f6db1ced4c431cd73.webm?t=1749238671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/dfcdb1346d12317f6db1ced4c431cd73.mp4?t=1749238671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish 2D Sprite Animation for Enemies and Bosses</strong><br>Each stage includes 4~6 types of monsters, 3 mid-bosses, and a powerful final boss.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/a7cc5885a53b6739f36184e9429304d8.poster.avif?t=1749238671\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/a7cc5885a53b6739f36184e9429304d8.webm?t=1749238671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/a7cc5885a53b6739f36184e9429304d8.mp4?t=1749238671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Replayability with 243 Achievements</strong><br>Test your skill and unlock everything the abyss has to offer.</p></li></ul>",
